+### Proposed: name the steward, and change intent only on the steward's recorded decision
+
+**Status**: Proposed 2026-10-07 by an entropy-assessment run. Awaiting the steward; not in effect.
+**Context**: No file names who decides what this project is for. `INTENT.md` asks to be "refined collaboratively — by humans and AI agents", `AGENTS.md` ("Consult INTENT.md for significant decisions") tells contributors to update `INTENT.md` themselves, the local guard's Skill / Intent Alignment check says the same, and no entry in this file carries an author or a date. Entry order is not a reliable guide either: "Two-layer generator architecture" points to its superseder "below", "Consolidate domain generators" to its superseder "above".
+**Proposal**: Name Justin Philpott as the steward. Agents record a change of intent here as a proposal; `INTENT.md` changes only after the steward's recorded decision. New entries in this file carry a date and who decided.
+**Impact if accepted**: `AGENTS.md` "Consult INTENT.md for significant decisions", `INTENT.md`'s preamble and the local guard change to match, and the local guard carries the intent-change rule with the steward named.
+
